      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even just triggers. it's like i've seen what things actually are, and now i'm back here and everything is just... empty. people are so obsessed with their tiny problems and their little jobs and it feels so pointless. i feel like i've outgrown this whole version of reality. like there's nothing left for me here.",
